ETED, JobState.FAILED} for job in jobs\n            ):\n                raise Conflict(\"VERIFIED_ORDER_OUTCOMES_REQUIRED\")","path":"robotops/integration/store.py","schema_version":"1.0","symbol":"IntegrationStore.complete_business"},"stage":21,"state_after":"COMPLETED","state_before":"RECONCILING","status":"COMPLETED","step_id":"1b37e109-a6de-5130-94b4-7f82cb38be97","summary":"ERP business completion","timestamp":"2026-10-06T04:01:38.477974Z","title":"ERP business completion","wire":{"business_status":"COMPLETED","order_id":"order-ad7003de-d17e-4beb-83ab-15b489b8dcf2","wms_acknowledged":true,"wms_acknowledgement_ids":["3c2c1e6c-7b97-500b-8884-bd4a4c2ee394"]}},{"authorization_required":false,"classification":"REAL CODE","command_id":"fa1a4534-8790-5ab3-a139-3aa9e482dbac","component":"trace","correlation_id":"0e802f29-4a53-5605-8c0b-9a91883f9a01","duration_ms":150.20689999801107,"evidence_ids":["636568e6-8b05-56f6-a4ba-9b6404ff36b7"],"execution_session_id":"7267ded4-1a30-541a-8366-7e98ebd04ff5","failure_semantics":"Query original command after uncertain effect; never blindly resend. Pre-effect and business failures require explicit retry.","input":{"command_id":"fa1a4534-8790-5ab3-a139-3aa9e482dbac","request_id":"50a62144-48fa-4b17-aa88-5c93345126bf","stage":22},"invariant":"Each evidence ID refers to persisted backend work.","job_id":"a6b64ed3-cf1f-5383-a122-1a7a1eaeef77","order_id":"order-ad7003de-d17e-4beb-83ab-15b489b8dcf2","output":{"acknowledgement_semantics":"HTTP accepted != DB commit != publisher confirm != consumer ACK != PLC acceptance != controller success != verification != WMS ACK != ERP completion","correlation_id":"0e802f29-4a53-5605-8c0b-9a91883f9a01","event_count":56,"job_ids":["a6b64ed3-cf1f-5383-a122-1a7a1eaeef77"],"order_id":"order-ad7003de-d17e-4beb-83ab-15b489b8dcf2","session_id":"7267ded4-1a30-541a-8366-7e98ebd04ff5","stage_count":22},"persistence_effect":"Authorization and bounded operation evidence committed; no transaction held while waiti